# Batch 002 passage-note placement findings

Read all 41 supplied candidates, complete Pali stretches, and source paragraphs. Supplemental full Pali, Bodhi translation and upstream HTML were read for AN10.35 and SN35.150 to recover their first omitted rows and preceding ellipsis boundaries. Judgment uses Pali as authority and source paragraph boundaries as evidence. Proposed changes preserve every source word, punctuation, link/reference and markup in source order. Editorial notes are prose, including notes that replace verses. No corpus changes or commits were made.

Totals: 41 judged; 26 move; 15 leave; 0 uncertain.

